{"seq":28,"slug":"log-engineering","title":"日志工程","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.27,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"日志工程\">日志工程</h1><p>日志是软件系统中最古老、最普遍的可观测性信号。与 metrics 的聚合计数和 traces 的因果链路不同，日志捕获的是离散事件的完整上下文快照——一条错误消息、一次数据库慢查询、一个用户操作的详细参数。日志工程关注的不是&quot;要不要记日志&quot;，而是如何在 PB 级规模下让日志从&quot;写了就忘的文本文件&quot;进化为&quot;可查询、可关联、可驱动告警&quot;的工程化资产。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦日志信号本身的全生命周期工程实践：从产生（结构化设计、级别分类、标准规范），经过管道（采集、存储、解析），到消费（查询、告警、分析），再到运营（留存、合规、成本）。它不覆盖观测性三支柱的整体架构设计（参见 <a href=\"../observability/\">observability</a>）、也不涉及 SRE 的故障响应与容量规划方法论（参见 <a href=\"../site-reliability-engineering/\">site-reliability-engineering</a>）。简言之：observability hub 回答&quot;为什么需要日志&quot;，SRE hub 回答&quot;日志如何支撑运维决策&quot;，而本 hub 回答&quot;日志系统本身如何设计、建设与运营&quot;。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先读第一章「基础」建立结构化日志的设计心智模型，再进入第二章「管道」理解端到端数据流，第三章「分析与告警」学习如何从日志中提取价值，最后第四章「运营」处理生产环境中的成本与合规约束。</p>\n<p>前置知识：熟悉至少一种后端语言的日志库使用（如 Go slog、Python logging、Java SLF4J）；了解 JSON 格式；有基本的分布式系统部署经验。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-logging-design","title":"结构化日志设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/structured-logging-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"log-levels-taxonomy","title":"日志级别与分类体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/log-levels-taxonomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"logging-standards-conventions","title":"日志标准与规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/logging-standards-conventions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline","title":"管道","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collection-agents-shipping","title":"采集代理与传输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/collection-agents-shipping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elk-loki-clickhouse","title":"ELK、Loki 与 ClickHouse","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/elk-loki-clickhouse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"log-parsing-enrichment","title":"日志解析与富化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/log-parsing-enrichment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"analysis-alerting","title":"分析与告警","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"log-query-patterns","title":"日志查询模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-query-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"log-based-alerting","title":"基于日志的告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-based-alerting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"log-analytics-ml","title":"日志分析与异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-analytics-ml"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retention-lifecycle","title":"留存与生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/retention-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compliance-audit-trail","title":"合规与审计追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/compliance-audit-trail"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization-sampling","title":"成本优化与采样策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/cost-optimization-sampling"}]}]}